1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,040
F*ck!

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:03,490
you've already become one.

3
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:05,130
How would you still have bad luck?

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,450
Mungkorn.

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:11,260
Take him back home for a visit.

6
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:14,120
If there's any misunderstanding,
talk it out.

7
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,840
Why you always have cat food with you.

8
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:16,910
You're just like a cat.

9
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:19,030
That's why you attract them.

10
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,580
Can you please call me...

11
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,420
Thear the way your mom calls me?

12
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:27,480
Goodnight,

13
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:29,960
Thear.

14
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,160
Hey.

15
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,890
You woke up for a run
without even telling me.

16
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,610
I saw you were still asleep,

17
00:00:42,770 --> 00:00:43,600
so I didn't want to wake you.

18
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,740
I guess I was having a really good dream.

19
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:49,310
Cause someone cuddled me last night,
I ended up sleeping in.

20
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:10,530
Why are you in such a rush?

21
00:01:10,660 --> 00:01:11,700
How about another lap?

22
00:01:11,890 --> 00:01:12,690
That's enough for me.

23
00:01:13,410 --> 00:01:15,090
Come on, run with me
for just one more lap.

24
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:16,070
You go run by yourself.

25
00:01:16,090 --> 00:01:17,800
Let's go together. Please?

26
00:01:29,730 --> 00:01:31,110
Look at you.

27
00:01:31,630 --> 00:01:33,130
Are you trying to
get a chance to hug me?

28
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,440
Wasn't all that cuddling
last night enough for you?

29
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:37,360
There's no need to pretend to fall.

30
00:01:40,410 --> 00:01:41,910
It was an accident.

31
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:43,540
You're talking nonsense.

32
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:46,970
Getting scolded by you in the morning
really wakes me up.

33
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:48,650
I feel like I could run
another hundred kilometers.

34
00:01:48,690 --> 00:01:50,870
- Let's go run together.
- Then go run by yourself.

35
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:52,500
I'm heading home.

36
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,420
Hey!

37
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:02,930
Hey!

38
00:03:14,510 --> 00:03:15,660
Where are we now?

39
00:03:16,210 --> 00:03:17,440
We've reached Chiang Mai.

40
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,020
In Chiang Mai already?

41
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,010
I only dozed off for a second.

42
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,930
Three hours is just a second to you?

43
00:03:24,670 --> 00:03:27,350
You just left me driving all by myself.

44
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:30,290
But it's okay. Watching you sleep
was actually nice.

45
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:36,880
Inspector.

46
00:03:36,940 --> 00:03:37,620
See?

47
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:39,700
I've already told you

48
00:03:39,730 --> 00:03:42,310
to call me Thear.

49
00:03:45,740 --> 00:03:46,770
Thear...

50
00:03:47,530 --> 00:03:50,490
Would you mind if we made a stop first?

51
00:03:50,730 --> 00:03:53,320
The shop is right on the way home.

52
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,640
What kind of shop is that?

53
00:03:55,550 --> 00:03:56,500
A shaved ice place.

54
00:03:57,380 --> 00:04:00,790
Does that mean this whole trip
wasn't sweet enough?

55
00:04:01,790 --> 00:04:03,360
The sweetness from Thear

56
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,400
might not be good for my health.

57
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:07,050
But I think the sweets here

58
00:04:07,630 --> 00:04:09,780
are the best.

59
00:04:10,630 --> 00:04:11,870
Of course.

60
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,710
Wherever you want to eat,
I'll take you.

61
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:18,960
When it comes to spoiling his boyfriend,
nobody does it better than Thear.

62
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:37,030
Oh, it's closed.

63
00:04:37,460 --> 00:04:38,660
I've been wanting to eat here.

64
00:04:39,580 --> 00:04:41,250
Do you really want to have it that badly?

65
00:04:41,340 --> 00:04:42,370
Should we go somewhere else?

66
00:04:42,970 --> 00:04:44,010
It's fine.

67
00:04:44,230 --> 00:04:45,450
I just really like this place.

68
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,450
Sometimes it's not about the taste.

69
00:04:48,570 --> 00:04:50,110
It's more about the vibes.

70
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,190
Alright.

71
00:04:57,100 --> 00:04:58,650
I'll bring you back another day then,

72
00:04:59,060 --> 00:04:59,700
okay?

73
00:05:02,070 --> 00:05:03,380
Let's head back.

74
00:05:04,530 --> 00:05:05,200
Okay.

75
00:05:21,090 --> 00:05:24,070
(Yin as Theartha)

76
00:05:29,010 --> 00:05:31,740
(War as Mungkorn)

77
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:38,230
(Shane as Phuwin)

78
00:05:38,660 --> 00:05:41,700
(Boss as Lukplub)

79
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:45,810
(Krit as Kanin)

80
00:05:46,070 --> 00:05:48,020
(Tang as Nadol)

81
00:05:51,500 --> 00:05:56,740
(Tay as Saming)

82
00:06:43,510 --> 00:06:44,810
Hello, Sinthawee.

83
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:46,310
How are you, Thear?

84
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:48,550
Are you well-rested yet?

85
00:06:49,170 --> 00:06:51,530
If you are, it's time
to get back to work.

86
00:06:51,550 --> 00:06:52,550
What?

87
00:06:54,210 --> 00:06:55,340
Back to...?

88
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:57,460
Am I really going back to work?

89
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,270
(Yes.)

90
00:06:58,390 --> 00:07:00,500
(The autopsy results are finally out.)

91
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:03,160
(Ronnaphop's last molar)

92
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,700
had poison hidden inside it.

93
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:08,610
(He intended to break that tooth
to commit suicide.)

94
00:07:09,050 --> 00:07:09,980
And now,

95
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:13,260
you've been cleared of the charges.

96
00:07:13,550 --> 00:07:15,540
Understood, sir. Thank you so much.

97
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:17,360
I'm so ready to get back to work now.

98
00:07:18,010 --> 00:07:18,790
(And one more thing.)

99
00:07:19,740 --> 00:07:22,110
Don't forget to thank Mungkorn.

100
00:07:22,140 --> 00:07:23,780
The moment he arrived at the station,

101
00:07:23,870 --> 00:07:27,070
he rushed to get
those autopsy results for you.

102
00:07:30,970 --> 00:07:32,470
Yes, sir. I will.

103
00:07:33,090 --> 00:07:34,670
I'll go thank Mungkorn as well.

104
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:36,260
Thank you, Uncle.

105
00:07:36,870 --> 00:07:37,600
Oh,

106
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:39,780
the intel reports that

107
00:07:40,100 --> 00:07:44,060
the Black Bull drug has effects
similar to a date rape drug.

108
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:47,620
(Initially, it causes intoxication.)

109
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,900
But after a while,

110
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:52,340
it triggers an uncontrollable,
intense sexual arousal.

111
00:07:52,450 --> 00:07:54,340
If you spot anyone with those symptoms,

112
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:58,310
you could assume that they've
taken the Black Bull drug.

113
00:07:58,420 --> 00:07:59,250
(Copy that, sir.)

114
00:07:59,370 --> 00:08:01,800
(I'll give it my best this time.)

115
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:02,460
Good.

116
00:08:04,090 --> 00:08:05,050
All set.

117
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:08,690
You really seem to care about him.

118
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:11,960
Well, he's my boss.

119
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,680
But thank you anyway, sir.

120
00:08:36,370 --> 00:08:37,040
Whoa!

121
00:08:38,050 --> 00:08:38,840
Hey!

122
00:08:40,190 --> 00:08:40,910
Wow!

123
00:08:43,330 --> 00:08:44,890
Hunglay!

124
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:48,270
I missed you.

125
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:49,820
I missed you so much.

126
00:09:02,070 --> 00:09:04,650
I wish I were a bike.

127
00:09:04,890 --> 00:09:08,590
So I could get all those kisses,
hugs, and cuddles from you.

128
00:09:10,470 --> 00:09:12,870
I called to get them
to speed up the delivery.

129
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,620
Thank you so much.

130
00:09:15,870 --> 00:09:18,350
I finally have a bike to ride to work.

131
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:19,420
What?

132
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,350
Do you mean we won't go
to work together anymore?

133
00:09:22,370 --> 00:09:23,870
I'm finally getting
back to work, you know.

134
00:09:25,590 --> 00:09:28,150
Well, congratulations on that.

135
00:09:29,650 --> 00:09:31,380
Oh, acting all happy for me?

136
00:09:31,490 --> 00:09:33,670
Weren't you the one who helped me?

137
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,900
But I'm curious now,

138
00:09:41,110 --> 00:09:43,660
did you help me as a subordinate,

139
00:09:44,310 --> 00:09:47,250
or as a husband?

140
00:09:50,170 --> 00:09:51,020
Well.

141
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,540
Maybe a bit of both.

142
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,070
My mom taught me that

143
00:09:56,090 --> 00:10:00,450
when you're under someone's roof,
you should be helpful.

144
00:10:03,750 --> 00:10:05,620
I don't really need you to be helpful.

145
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:08,290
I much prefer you helping me
with something else.

146
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:19,540
You're completely twisting the idea,

147
00:10:19,740 --> 00:10:21,890
making something meaningful
seem ambiguous.

148
00:10:22,680 --> 00:10:25,240
Since it's here,
why don't we take it for a ride?

149
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:26,710
You sure?

150
00:10:27,420 --> 00:10:28,660
Whoa!

151
00:10:28,830 --> 00:10:32,440
You'll get to see just
how powerful Hunglay really is.

152
00:10:44,620 --> 00:10:46,470
He needs to warm up a bit.
He might not be used to Chiang Mai.

153
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:57,500
Let's go.

154
00:10:58,490 --> 00:10:59,600
Hold tight.

155
00:11:00,110 --> 00:11:01,060
Let's go!

156
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,830
♪And you look into my eyes,♪

157
00:11:04,850 --> 00:11:09,160
♪It's too much
for this heart to keep inside♪

158
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:12,160
♪Almost forgot how to breathe,♪

159
00:11:12,190 --> 00:11:14,650
♪How could you do this to me?♪

160
00:11:14,670 --> 00:11:20,240
♪Told you to stop,
but you wouldn't agree♪

161
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:23,180
♪With all the evidence I have found,♪

162
00:11:23,210 --> 00:11:27,090
♪Guess I'll have to take you
into custody now♪

163
00:11:27,110 --> 00:11:31,910
♪That level of cuteness
is against the law♪

164
00:11:31,930 --> 00:11:36,010
♪I must be under your spell,
can I blame you at all?♪

165
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:36,980
I told you so.

166
00:11:37,010 --> 00:11:38,490
Hunglay is the real deal.

167
00:11:38,580 --> 00:11:40,620
Engine's fired up and ready to go.

168
00:11:41,790 --> 00:11:42,790
Ready to go?

169
00:11:43,380 --> 00:11:45,590
We had to pray just to get it started.

170
00:11:45,770 --> 00:11:47,940
He has some tricks

171
00:11:48,380 --> 00:11:49,570
that make him more valuable,
you know?

172
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:54,020
Just like his owner, right?

173
00:12:11,450 --> 00:12:13,220
You weren't even gonna share them?

174
00:12:13,380 --> 00:12:14,950
I'm about to choke on these snacks.

175
00:12:15,150 --> 00:12:17,020
I actually bought some for you, too.

176
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:19,740
Here.

177
00:12:20,340 --> 00:12:21,680
Want me to feed you?

178
00:12:21,860 --> 00:12:23,660
That won't be necessary.

179
00:12:23,830 --> 00:12:25,040
Careful, you're gonna spill it.

180
00:12:26,440 --> 00:12:27,830
Come on. Cheers.

181
00:12:29,130 --> 00:12:31,070
Let's celebrate you getting back to work.

182
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:34,480
You got it. Cheers!

183
00:12:54,430 --> 00:12:55,980
What are you trying to do?

184
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:06,510
You're eating like a messy little kid.

185
00:13:14,730 --> 00:13:15,580
Thank you.

186
00:13:21,650 --> 00:13:23,490
You know, ever since
we got back from Phayao,

187
00:13:23,650 --> 00:13:25,150
I'm not sure if you've noticed,

188
00:13:25,890 --> 00:13:27,120
but I feel like I've changed.

189
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,060
You've changed?

190
00:13:35,410 --> 00:13:37,220
Did you eat more or gain weight?

191
00:13:37,610 --> 00:13:38,880
I don't mean that.

192
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:41,120
My body is still as fit as ever. See?

193
00:13:41,630 --> 00:13:42,840
I'm still healthy.

194
00:13:44,260 --> 00:13:45,590
It's something in my heart.

195
00:13:46,130 --> 00:13:47,700
I just feel much happier now.

196
00:13:48,200 --> 00:13:49,820
I feel like I'm more fulfilled.

197
00:13:50,790 --> 00:13:53,380
Like, I've seen another side of someone.

198
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:57,450
Maybe someone's opening up to me.

199
00:14:02,310 --> 00:14:04,270
I've been open this whole time.

200
00:14:05,640 --> 00:14:07,040
You just didn't see it.

201
00:14:10,650 --> 00:14:12,130
Then keep it open, okay?

202
00:14:12,930 --> 00:14:14,000
Because from now on,

203
00:14:14,530 --> 00:14:16,660
I won't take my eyes off you.

204
00:14:48,420 --> 00:14:49,990
Why did you bring me here?

205
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:51,000
Hey.

206
00:14:51,310 --> 00:14:53,960
I've got to take you out
for something fun.

207
00:14:54,180 --> 00:14:55,970
So you can relax and unwind.

208
00:14:56,210 --> 00:14:57,140
A bathhouse?

209
00:14:57,970 --> 00:14:59,090
No way.

210
00:14:59,410 --> 00:15:00,630
I can shower by myself.

211
00:15:01,160 --> 00:15:02,510
What kind of guy do you think I am?

212
00:15:03,170 --> 00:15:06,160
Even though I was a playboy
and went to those places,

213
00:15:06,190 --> 00:15:08,620
I haven't been there ever since
I've been with you.

214
00:15:09,950 --> 00:15:11,050
That won't be necessary.

215
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:13,980
You should just let someone bathe you
like you always do.

216
00:15:14,010 --> 00:15:15,800
Come on, that's not happening.

217
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:18,080
The only one who gets to bathe me

218
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:21,010
is you.

219
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:37,080
This is my regular hangout spot.

220
00:15:37,230 --> 00:15:39,880
They have pool tables,
hot springs, saunas, a gym,

221
00:15:40,060 --> 00:15:41,790
and even special massages

222
00:15:43,370 --> 00:15:44,360
From the sound of it,

223
00:15:45,110 --> 00:15:46,940
this place seems like heaven for you.

224
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:51,470
Do you want to go to heaven with me?

225
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:55,940
Mungkorn!

226
00:15:56,790 --> 00:15:58,210
Wait, what?

227
00:15:59,140 --> 00:15:59,940
Lukplub.

228
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,010
Lukplub.

229
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:02,460
Phuwin.

230
00:16:02,570 --> 00:16:03,700
What are you guys doing here?

231
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:06,720
Phuwin was invited to celebrate
Thear's return to work.

232
00:16:06,780 --> 00:16:09,250
- I see.
- And I missed you so much too.

233
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:11,080
I wanted to see how you're doing here.

234
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:12,700
It's good.

235
00:16:12,930 --> 00:16:14,440
There's always something exciting here.

236
00:16:16,530 --> 00:16:17,820
What about you, Thear?

237
00:16:18,110 --> 00:16:20,220
Are you taking good care
of my brother like you promised?

238
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:22,640
Well, I just carried him up here.

239
00:16:22,660 --> 00:16:24,500
All that's left is
to have him sit on my lap.

240
00:16:25,070 --> 00:16:25,910
Happy now?

241
00:16:26,010 --> 00:16:27,100
That much?

242
00:16:29,710 --> 00:16:30,640
And...

243
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:32,160
How did you end up here?

244
00:16:33,970 --> 00:16:35,000
I invited him myself.

245
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:37,930
If we work together, we should
hang out to get to know each other.

246
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:42,000
Actually, that's not really necessary.

247
00:16:42,540 --> 00:16:44,080
I don't want to be that close to you.

248
00:16:45,020 --> 00:16:47,650
I think staying in my room
and reading books would be better.

249
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:50,480
You just stay cooped up in your room
and never meet anyone.

250
00:16:50,510 --> 00:16:51,920
No wonder you're still single.

251
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,880
I'm single, and I'm fine with it.

252
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,630
I enjoy my life.

253
00:16:56,610 --> 00:16:58,250
You've got to give it a try.

254
00:16:58,610 --> 00:16:59,910
You never know until you try.

255
00:17:00,690 --> 00:17:01,360
He's right.

256
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:02,900
You've got to try.

257
00:17:04,020 --> 00:17:04,750
Oh.

258
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:07,790
How did you come here with Thear?

259
00:17:19,790 --> 00:17:20,570
Well.

260
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:25,520
My place is very close to his,
so we just came together.

261
00:17:26,620 --> 00:17:27,350
Hold on a second.

262
00:17:27,630 --> 00:17:29,190
Aren't you staying at the police flats?

263
00:17:33,730 --> 00:17:35,860
The police flats were full.

264
00:17:35,890 --> 00:17:38,030
- So I couldn't move in...
- Actually, they aren't full.

265
00:17:38,290 --> 00:17:39,630
There are plenty of rooms left.

266
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,510
What?

267
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:44,990
What's going on here?

268
00:17:50,290 --> 00:17:52,370
The flats in Chiang Mai are quite old.

269
00:17:52,420 --> 00:17:55,780
I suggested that Mungkorn
find a place to rent.

270
00:17:56,150 --> 00:17:57,280
That's probably more convenient.

271
00:17:59,490 --> 00:18:01,150
Don't make a big deal out of it.

272
00:18:01,340 --> 00:18:03,260
We're neighbors.

273
00:18:03,350 --> 00:18:05,800
It's normal for us
to come together, right?

274
